{
 "_about": "The config of the v6 report (t16 / t17 / t18, 2026-11-03), kept as the regression case of the builder: build_report.py --config this file gives the page that results/BEV_result_report/report.html is (it was results/t16/report_big.html, the same bytes; test_report_build.py --real). Paths are relative to bev_fusion/.",
